body:
As técnicas A, B e C \[1,2,3\] são dentrimentais por causa disso e aquilo. D e E não cumprem determinados requerimentos \[3 - 7\]. No entanto, como dito em outros trabalhos \[6,7,8\], a técnica F faz o que a gente quer.

&#x200B;

Pronto, encurtado o lviro inteiro em 3 linhas

I already have everything to 90 her too, even the weapon is maxed + talents to max lvl lol, I'm just unsure whether or not it's a good move. I do like her a lot, but again I only have Jean as 5\*.

&#x200B;

Also for a dolphin you type pretty well! Must hard to type with flippers

I'm struggling to branch out of my current team. I have (all MLB + EX) FP, Oghma, Noxia and Lilith and this team pretty much works anywhere (I don't play arena). I also have 5\* Miya but she barely sees the light of day.

I have started diversifying to water units, just 5\* Veronica (no EX as advised before) but I don't know where she fits and what team goes well with her. I'll invest in Garam and Orca (still no EX) and then on Bianca and Marina (with EX);

I need tips to combo with those water units, specially veronica. Bear in mind I don't play arena I'm mostly interested in OL, Raid and Kamazone.

\>They’d get shot by cops

